            "block_content": "The stewards, with notice to their immediate superior and permission thereof during their working hours without loss of time or pay, shall investigate and present grievances to the employer, providing such actions do not interfere with the operations of the County department. Only one steward in a department may engage in such investigations of grievances and the maximum time allowed per day shall be one (1) hour, unless more time is needed to reasonably conclude or pursue the matter.",
